From fd6c3a42b059ecec49c52c9ad4f0bd61855c0494 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Tue, 30 Jun 2026 11:51:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 05046/11362] [outer-loop] route conductor audits to codex via
 AGENT_TYPE_AUDIT (Claude quota-conserve)

Operator 2026-06-30: Claude quota at 8% until ~tomorrow noon -> switch the
conductor to codex for EVERYTHING incl planner/retro/adversarial-audits.

- Add call_codex (codex exec --model gpt-5.5, stdin) + 'codex' choice + dispatch
  to the 3 milestone-close audit scripts (verifier_authenticity / pages_adversarial
  / arc_self_solve), which previously only supported claude/gemini.
- Make the conductor's 3 hardcoded '--model claude' audit invocations env-routable
  via AGENT_TYPE_AUDIT/AGENT_MODEL_AUDIT (default claude/opus = unchanged behavior).

Planner/retro -> codex is set via the systemd drop-in 50-claude-quota-conserve-
20260630.conf (host config, not tracked). Revert = delete that drop-in + restart;
the audit scripts' codex path stays (inert unless selected).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
